Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:15:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/10] ir3: Calibrate Adreno 830 register file to 96 vec4s

Stabilizes high register-pressure fragment and compute shaders on Adreno 830
(Snapdragon 8 Elite) without causing IR3 scheduler register allocation panic.
---
 src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_compiler.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_compiler.c b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_compiler.c
index 56789ab..cdef012 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_compiler.c
+++ b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_compiler.c
@@ -210,7 +210,7 @@ ir3_compiler_create(struct fd_device *dev, const struct fd_dev_id *dev_id,
       compiler->reg_size_vec4 = 96; /* Calibrated for A830 architecture stability */
